    {
      "source": "<i>Note: Empty <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collections</code></a> are not added to\nthe model when using this method because we cannot correctly determine\nthe true convention name. View code should check for <code>null</code> rather\nthan for empty collections as is already done by JSTL tags.</i>",
